  $ maniac remove marked nowhere-xyz
  [exit 1]
  marked   removed
  nowhere-xyz   maniac installed no page for it.
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_every_command_as_a_user_sees_it[maniac scan --help]
  '''
  $ maniac scan --help
  [exit 0]
  
   Usage: maniac scan [OPTIONS] [tools]...
  
   Your other tools and their pages, found across your login $PATH.
  
   Best effort. With no tools: every tool an installer put on your login
   $PATH that maniac has no page for (`list` shows those it has), then a
   count of everything passed over, and why. With tools: exactly those.
  
  ╭─ Arguments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │   tools      <str>  Tools to report on. With none, every tool on your login $PATH maniac has no page for.            │
  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  ╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │ --names              Bare tool names, one per line, even on a terminal.                                              │
  │ --outdated           Only pages that document another version.                                                       │
  │ --unknown            Only pages whose version nothing proves either way.                                             │
  │ --available          Only tools with a shipped or upstream page not yet installed.                                   │
  │ --missing            Only tools with no page to install; only a generated one is left.                               │
  │ --help               Show this message and exit.                                                                     │
  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_every_command_as_a_user_sees_it[maniac scan --missing]
  '''
  $ maniac scan --missing
  [exit 0]
  cowsay
  cowthink
  --- stderr
  Not shown: 2 more on your $PATH
        1 have a page from maniac: `maniac list`
        1 no installer claims: `maniac why <tool>`
  
  '''
# ---
